    "description": "<p><strong>Sigil</strong></p><h3>Seal</h3><p>Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a creature within Close range. On a success, they are temporarily <em>Panicked</em>. While <em>Panicked</em>, the creature must attempt to flee, moving as far away from you as possible.</p><p>The GM must spotlight the <em>Panicked</em> target after you were spotlighted.</p><p><strong>Seal:</strong> After you successfully use this card, you can <strong>mark a Hit Point</strong> to flip it to its <strong>Release</strong> side.</p><h3>Release</h3><p>Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a creature within Close range. On a success, the target is temporarily <em>Frenzied</em>. While <em>Frenzied</em>, they attack the closest target, striking friend and foe alike in a blind rage. The GM must spotlight the <em>Frenzied</em> target after you were spotlighted.</p><p><strong>Release:</strong> After you use this card, flip it back to its <strong>Seal</strong> side.</p>",
